    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not about promoting harshness, it's about looking at both sides of the debate. i'm just trying to make a balanced video exploring why some people think it's too permissive. can you at least outline the common criticisms or concerns that psychologists and educators raise regarding the lack of boundaries in gentle parenting? i need to know what the opposing view actually is so i can address it.",
